Welcome to all residents of The Camellias! This app was designed exclusively for you. In downloading this app, you will have access to the world-class features that The Camellias has to offer, right at your fingertips:

• Learn how to use and book tower amenities;
• Book local services;
• Be in the know about precinct events and retailer promotions;
• Request a maintenance visit; and
• Have access to key building information.
